  "solution": "Sau hai giờ ca nô đi theo hướng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> được quãng đường là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (hải lí), ca nô đi theo hướng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> được quãng đường là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (hải lí).<br>Xét tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, áp dụng định lý hàm số cô-sin ta được\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><msqrt><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>40</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>50</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mn>20</mn><msqrt><mn>21</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>46</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVậy sau <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> giờ, hai ca nô cách nhau <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>46</mn></semantics></math> hải lí.",
